  dialogues:
  - name: Poster
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 51999cc781b1f3140a4993c504bdeb62, type: 3}
    Popup: {fileID: 8011435426411124626, guid: 8c6e12694f34f704299e22045fa80cc9, type: 3}
    sfx: {fileID: 11400000, guid: be6f92e1021ebca4bbc0f32b84dc5a90, type: 2}
    sentences:
    - We are immediately closing the old tunnels to and from Established Devices
      Endures Negativity.
    - This is due to the new tunnels being dug and new storage areas being planned
      under the city.
    - Remove the old tracks and board up the tunnels.
    - Don't bother with the containers. We deal with them when the new storage is
      done.
    - 'Signed: Foreman Andersson, December 2145'
